  "ui.town.quest.ilda.0": "Bring me three dew herbs: this morning's, not yesterday's.",
  "ui.town.quest.ilda.1": "A mossy trout. They say it keeps the water of an older river.",
  "ui.town.quest.ilda.2": "Plant sweet fern in your garden and bring me two.",
  "ui.town.quest.ilda.3": "Go down into Deepwood. Something down there is changing my berries.",
  "ui.town.quest.velda.0": "Copper moss grows on the mechanisms. Bring me three.",
  "ui.town.quest.velda.1": "A pinion fish from the pond: it has gear teeth.",
  "ui.town.quest.velda.2": "Enter the Chronal Ruins. I want to know what order the automatons are waiting for.",
  "ui.town.quest.kael.0": "Three frost crystals. Training in the cold teaches fast.",
  "ui.town.quest.kael.1": "An ice trout. You need patience: that is the lesson.",
  "ui.town.quest.kael.2": "In the Time Labyrinth there is a guardian who fights before you arrive. Defeat it.",
  "ui.town.quest.brann.0": "Igneous roots: they burn slow, like the forge I found down below.",
  "ui.town.quest.brann.1": "Two volcano chilies from your garden. Heat can be grown too.",
  "ui.town.quest.brann.2": "Go down into the Igneous Rift. That old mechanism is still running and I want to know why.",
  "ui.town.quest.oren.0": "Echo dust: what the future leaves behind when it passes.",
  "ui.town.quest.oren.1": "An echo fish. You already caught it; you just don't know it yet.",
  "ui.town.quest.oren.2": "Two ears of echo wheat. They have to grow in your town.",
  "ui.town.quest.oren.3": "Enter the Abyss. What has to happen, happens down there.",
  "ui.town.relic.frasco_ilda.name": "Ilda's Flask",
